Jupiter 2011 Chess (Mg2Upjjo2yg) sprites, m2 2026-11-26. All from the video's own thumbnail
(research/ref/fin2-jupiter/thumbs/maxresdefault.jpg, i.ytimg.com/vi/Mg2Upjjo2yg/maxresdefault.jpg, 1280x720):
- key.png: the red "F" Key cut out of the thumbnail (x120-370, y262-612): border flood fill of the tan board, largest
  component kept, holes filled; 512 px transparent, centred at ~90%. Same art as the in-game Keys (maxres1/maxres2).
- speed.png / queso.png / creek.png: the three astronaut portraits of the thumbnail, cut out with rembg
  (u2net_human_seg), separated along each other's outlines, converted to greyscale like the in-game sprites (the video's
  board shows the same photos in greyscale: research/ref/fin2-jupiter/video/full_map_t0000_1440p.jpg, maxres1.jpg).
  512 px transparent, bottom-aligned. Known limits: Speed's right cheek and Creek's left side are hidden behind Queso in
  the thumbnail and Creek is cut by the frame's right edge, so those sides follow the occluding outline.
Old own-drawn SVGs (speed/creek/queso/key/pod_l/m/r.svg) removed; they are in git history.
